.TH sway-things-hook-notification-click 1 "" "Sway Things 0.6.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-hook\-notification\-click \- Bring the window of a clicked notification\*(Aqs app to the front: run by swaync (as a script, with the notification in its environment) and mako (with \-\-mako) while the Notifications page says so
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things hook notification\-click\fR [\fB\-\-mako\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bring the window of a clicked notification\*(Aqs app to the front: run by swaync (as a script, with the notification in its environment) and mako (with \-\-mako) while the Notifications page says so
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-mako\fR \fI<ID>\fR
The id of mako\*(Aqs notification; mako runs the hook with it
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
